  "title": "LP2: a six-rune pattern inside words",
  "status": "published",
  "question": "Does c′ = 24 − 2c (mod 29) recur unusually often six runes later inside visible words?",
  "reader_question": "When two runes are six places apart inside a word, do they follow a specific rule more often than we would expect by chance?",
