    "procedure": "Count c′ = 24 − 2c at lag six within visible words; scan all 841 affine maps at that lag; compare with 2,000 seeded within-word shuffles.",
    "parameters": "56 unsolved pages; 1,267 word-internal opportunities; 841 affine maps c′ = ac + b modulo 29 at lag six; 2,000 shuffles.",
