  "outcome": "supported",
  "finding": "77 matches in 1,267 word-internal pairs, versus 44.8 expected after within-word shuffling. Only 3 of 2,000 shuffled grids reached 77 when the best of 841 affine maps at lag six was chosen. This measures a pattern, not an encryption rule.",
  "limitations": "Exploratory, post-selection analysis. The 841-map check does not adjust for trying other lags, segmentations or formulas. A within-word shuffle is not a cipher model.",
  "next_steps": "Compare independent transcriptions and prespecify boundary and lag rules; test a complete generator against held-out pages and the adjacent-repeat deficit.",
